translate english scene_c3_dc159467:

    # ming "你先闭上眼睛，专注于自己和飞行，只要你一直想着飘动在云彩之上，你就可以飞了。"
    ming "Close your eyes and focus on flying."
    ming "As long as you keep thinking about soaring above the clouds, you'll be able to fly."

