    # "避免万一，我拉起他的手腕，闭上眼睛，朝着碧蓝的天空飞去。"
    "Just in case, I grab and hold onto his wrist and fly towards the sky."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:198
translate english scene_c3_3a505f91:

    # "不同七郎，他的衣裳轻盈，适合少年在春天的时节穿。我的眼睛扫到他浓密的眼睫毛，注视着他的神情，他却低眉含笑，不敢看着我的眼睛。"
    "Unlike Qilang, his clothes are light and befitting of a young man in spring. "
    "I gaze at his thick eyelashes as I analyze his facial expression, but he just looks down and smiles, refusing to meet my gaze."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:199
translate english scene_c3_6264dd0a:

    # "如果他是神明，他应该每天都见到如山如海的民众拜祭他，如今见到我怎么就这么害羞。"
    "If he really is a deity, he should see thousands of people praying to him every day."
    "How come he is so bashful with me?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:200
translate english scene_c3_1e7efc2a:

    # "难道说他认生，和我不太熟悉。还是他曾今做过什么对不起我的事情，所以不敢看我的眼睛？飞在高空中，我的思绪越来越多，犹如我身旁的云彩。"
    "Could he actually be shy with strangers and feels unfamiliar with me?"
    "Or did he do something to me and is now feeling guilty, so he is unable to look me back in the eyes?"
    "More and more thoughts collect in my mind as we soared through the sky, just like the clouds surrounding me. "

# game/foxFairy.rpy:201
translate english scene_c3_c6267118:

    # "地上的芸芸众生就如尘埃一般渺小。"
    "Everything on the ground looks smaller and smaller as I dance from peak to peak among the clouds."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:202
translate english scene_c3_b405c52a:

    # "而我却可以在高峰之上，立足于云彩之间。当我们飞得越来越高，我的心有些颤抖，一定是我还不熟悉飞行，所以对着脚下空空的状态有些害怕。"
    "But the higher we go, the more my heart trembles. "
    "It must be that I'm still unfamiliar with flying, so I feel unsettling that there is no solid ground beneath my feet."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:204
translate english scene_c3_4d4e6c5c:

    # ming "（看着旁边的云彩）你的心跳好快。"
    ming "(looking at the clouds around us) Your heart is beating so quickly."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:205
translate english scene_c3_434f65c3:

    # "废话，第一次飞这么高，谁的心不会跳得快。"
    "Well, duh. Whose heart wouldn't if it was their first time flying so high?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:206
translate english scene_c3_0db7d11b:

    # "因为他比我还高了一个头，我慢慢靠近他的胸膛，我听到了一阵急促的呼吸声和心跳声。"
    "Because Jueming is a head taller than me, I start to lean into his chest and I hear his breathing and heartbeat speed up."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:208
translate english scene_c3_6b777645:

    # placeholder "你不是一样？"
    placeholder "Well, aren't you the same?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:210
translate english scene_c3_ac772187:

    # "好似我看穿了他的秘密一般，他的脸色有些发红。"
    "His face set aflame as if I had just seen through his secret."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:211
translate english scene_c3_8740a6a1:

    # "他这才盯着我的眼睛看，可是不过一会又有些失望。"
    "Only now does he return my gaze, but then he turns away disappointed after just a while."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:212
translate english scene_c3_a545c054:

    # ming "(叹气) 不一样。"
    ming "(sighs) It's not the same."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:213
translate english scene_c3_c5466042:

    # placeholder "我们往下飞会不会坠落？我可不想摔死。"
    placeholder "Will we fall if I fly downwards? I don't want to fall to my death."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:215
translate english scene_c3_8a79f0e4:

    # "他可能是发现我的手有些发抖，他突然拉着我的手，踏着云彩，平稳地着地。踩着七彩云，他握着我的手，模样有些俊朗。"
    "Maybe he feels my hands trembling, because he suddenly grabs hold of my hands and leads us on our descent to solid ground. "
    "I have to admit, he looks a little handsome like this--holding my hand as we descend from the clouds."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:216
translate english scene_c3_a9b72d28:

    # "有一瞬间，我有一个错觉，他是不是喜欢我。"
    "For a split second, I thought of the possibility of him liking me."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:217
translate english scene_c3_231ee7c5:

    # "这家伙要是喜欢我的话岂不是很尴尬，毕竟我现在失去了记忆，我可不想什么都取信于人。"
    "But honestly, I'd feel very awkward if this guy really likes me since I've lost my memories."
    "I don't want to depend on him for everything."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:219
translate english scene_c3_f81c313c:

    # "我慢跑到街上，看到一片繁荣的景象，和鸟不生蛋的村子完全不同。"
    "We land directly in a prospering city, and I jog onto the street, soaking up the hustle and bustle."
    "It's such a drastic change in scenery from the village out in the middle of nowhere."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:223
translate english scene_c3_d62f20f4:

    # "眼前的少年虽然美好，我对他刚刚嘲笑我的举动有些生气。"
    "Although this young man is nice, I'm still quite mad at him for laughing at me."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:224
translate english scene_c3_67b598c1:

    # "如果迷魂术真的有用的话，我想捉弄人一定很好玩。"
    "If this magic really works, it will definitely be fun to use to play with him."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:225
translate english scene_c3_a65633bc:

    # "迷魂术是要先眨左眼还是右眼？"
    "What was it that he said? Do I bat my left eye first, or my right eye?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:229
translate english scene_c3_86dc75f3:

    # "我想起月老刚说的方法，于是我先眨了左眼。"
    "I remember what he said, so I wink at him with my left eye first."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:230
translate english scene_c3_d1f53582:

    # "对我的举动有些困惑，月老偏了偏头，向我走近，像是要询问我。"
    "Confused by my action, Jueming tilts his head and walks towards me as if he wants to ask me something. "

# game/foxFairy.rpy:232
translate english scene_c3_4fadb10d:

    # "他的眼睛像小狗狗一样，有些无辜。现在才卖萌实在是太天真了。"
    "His eyes shine with innocence like those of a puppy's, but he's too naive if he thinks acting cute now will help him."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:233
translate english scene_c3_81048b33:

    # "我毫不犹豫地眨了眨眼，完成了迷魂术后面的步骤。"
    "Unhesitatingly, I blinked my eyes and completed the steps for the seduction magic."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:234
translate english scene_c3_50300ada:

    # "今天的太阳不算炎热，眼前的男子面色犹如昙花，白里透红，眼神迷离，又有些恍恍惚惚。"
    "The sun that hangs in the sky is not hot, yet the face of the young man in front of me was like that of a Queen of the Night flower, fair with a tinge of red."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:236
translate english scene_c3_85048352:

    # placeholder "你过来"
    placeholder "Come over here."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:238
translate english scene_c3_03bf578f:

    # "冬天的风吹动了他的发丝，我们之间的距离不到一尺，他身上有一片淡淡的兰草香味。"
    "We stand less than one foot apart."
    "The faint smell of orchids wafts in the air as the winter wind blows at his hair."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:239
translate english scene_c3_1caace33:

    # "上一秒，他还是那个腼腆却爱笑的男子， 而如今他的手搭在我的肩膀上，好似一个热情如火的情郎。"
