    # "画双修小黄书还这么理直气壮，果然第一印象误导了我。"
    "As I thought, my first impression of him has really misled me."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:277
translate english scene_c3_6bf2518a:

    # placeholder "（当量了一下他）看不出来啊，你这个家伙这么胆大。"
    placeholder "(scrutinize him) I never would've thought that you would be so bold."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:278
translate english scene_c3_608c120f:

    # ming "自豪，眨眼）在修仙时，我可是一个很用功的弟子呢，我超级注重细节的哦。"
    ming "(winks at me proudly) I was a very hard-working disciple when I was cultivating, you know?"
    ming "I really pay attention to details!"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:279
translate english scene_c3_e7e53894:

    # "强调了细节二字，难道是想映射什么。"
    "Putting emphasis on the word “details”... What is he hinting at?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:280
translate english scene_c3_7e8587f2:

    # "仔细想想，其实我和他也不太熟悉，第一次见面他竟然想双修？"
    "Now that I think about it, we're not really familiar with each other, and yet he wants to practice dual cultivation with me when this is the first time we've met?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:281
translate english scene_c3_c2a79051:

    # "这家伙比我还主动啊。如今的我对于过去没有一点印象，我最想知道的是关于我的一切，其他人或其他事都得靠边站。"
    "This guy is so bold."
    "I have no memories of my past and I desperately want to know everything about it. "
    "Who cares about other matters or people?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:283
translate english scene_c3_7f56ade5:

    # "我飞快的跑到了街道，甩开了这个男子。"
    "I quickly sped onto the streets, leaving the man behind."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:287
translate english scene_c4_4a06f37f:

    # "街道上的民众来来往往，个个都争先恐后地去往他们心中的地点，只有我独自忧愁和不知去往何方。"
    "Many people bustle about on the street, rushing to their desired destinations."
    "Only I stand aimlessly lost in the middle of it."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:289
translate english scene_c4_318ea339:

    # "漫天绵绵细雨，我仿佛听到了从乐坊传来的清冷琴声。"
    "All of a sudden, it starts to drizzle, and I think I hear a crisp melody of a zither from a nearby establishment. "

# game/foxFairy.rpy:290
translate english scene_c4_e0679ee0:

    # "杨柳垂在小溪旁，几个渔夫感叹这天降的微雨正好提高了他们垂钓的乐趣。"
    "Weeping willows hang above the stream as a few fishermen cheer for the rain which has boosted their enthusiasm for fishing."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:292
translate english scene_c4_87fb2006:

    # "就当人群慢慢分离，我准备找躲雨的地方时，一个小孩子拉着我的衣袖，想带我去一个地方。"
    "I am just about to search for a place to take cover from the rain as the crowd starts to disperse, when a little child comes up to me and tugs at my sleeve, "
    "telling me that he wants to bring me somewhere."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:293
translate english scene_c4_e87cbc8a:

    # "我反手就把那孩子提了起来。询问一番，他说一个大哥哥在前面的桥头等我。"
    "I pick him up and, after a few questions, he reveals that a young man is waiting for me at the start of the bridge just up front."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:295
translate english scene_c4_0e5a0649:

    # "不会吧，觉明已经知道我在哪里了？我不慌不忙地走向桥头，无数的雨伞遮住了前面的道路。"
    "No way, did Jueming find me already?"
    "Calmly, I walk toward the bridge, dodging the numerous umbrellas that block my way."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:296
translate english scene_c4_0eddcabe:

    # "落雨时节，一群身着不同色彩的衣裳的人从我眼前聚集又匆忙离开。"
    "People clad in all sorts of colorful clothes pass me by in a hurry, desperate to get out of the rain."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:297
translate english scene_c4_f80322ed:

    # "不似周围赶路的人，有一人穿着黑色的斗篷，未持雨伞，慢慢的靠近我。"
    "Among them is a man wearing a dark cloak."
    "He stands out from the crowd because he isn't holding an umbrella."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:299
translate english scene_c4_e6638eb4:

    # "神秘又潇洒，他偏过头，故弄玄虚，让我看不清他的样子。"
    "His demeanor is mysterious yet I can see that he is at ease as he slowly approaches me."
    "He turns his head to the side so I can't see his face."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:300
translate english scene_c4_a5add6d5:

    # placeholder "你是谁，找我做什么？为何带着遮住面容的斗篷？你就这么见不得人吗？"
    placeholder "Who are you? Why are you looking for me?"
    placeholder "Why are you covering your face with the cloak? What are you trying to hide?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:301
translate english scene_c4_f86086d8:

    # dude8 "世间千万人，一人便有百般姿态。"
    dude8 "There are so many people in this world, each with so many faces of their own. "

# game/foxFairy.rpy:302
translate english scene_c4_a7a36ee2:

    # dude8 "你已不是这凡尘之人，怎会被色相迷惑？以此推算，你又怎么会在乎我是否蒙面？"
    dude8 "You're no longer a mortal, how could you possibly be tricked by mere appearances?"
    dude8 "Following this line of thought, why would you care if I covered my face or not?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:304
translate english scene_c4_d669b3c4:

    # "我在两秒中打量了一下他，他身姿优雅，比一般男子至少高了许多，可是他却不以面示人，估计是颜值不过关吧。"
    "I use two seconds to scrutinize him."
    "He has an elegant figure and he's much taller than an average man, but seeing as how he covers his face, he might be unattractive."


# game/foxFairy.rpy:305
translate english scene_c4_d9e34526:

    # "我对普男的那套避重就轻的说辞很敏锐。"
    "I'm pretty familiar with the way ordinary men try to get women curious about them, while persuading women to neglect their physical flaws."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:306
translate english scene_c4_b04e8ad8:

    # "就在我要头也不回，留他一人在雨中凌乱，我隐约看到了他的那双眼睛。"
    "Just as I turn to leave him standing alone in the rain, I catch a glimpse of his eyes under his hood."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:307
translate english scene_c4_7e8d32e4:

    # "百般柔情，千分惆怅，他的眼晴就像云间皎洁的月亮，纵使身处群星璀璨的夜晚，也能让人一眼万年。"
    "Those eyes held the gentlest sentiments yet also hid the most melancholy."
    "They were like the shining moon, one could stare at them forever even if they stood among thousands and thousands of glimmering stars in the night sky."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:308
translate english scene_c4_696fc10c:

    # "我觉得我好像在哪里见过这双眼睛。我决定"
    "I feel like I've seen these eyes before somewhere."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:311
translate english scene_c4_00f8f986:

    # "我本来都准备走人，奈何我的身体太诚实了，以至于我还想留下来，看他面纱下的模样。"
    "I was going to leave, but my body refused to cooperate."
    "So I end up staying and trying to peer at his face through the face veil he wears."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:312
translate english scene_c4_13163d7b:

    # "细雨打湿了眼眶，我有时需要抹开令我眼酸的雨水才能看清前方。"
    "The continuous drizzle stings my eyes and I have to wipe the water away to get a clear look at the man."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:314
translate english scene_c4_f1dda639:

    # "隔着面罩，他的声音听起来是一个少年。"
    "He sounds like a youth through the veil."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:315
translate english scene_c4_e5e7d403:

    # "浓密的头发，白皙的皮肤，落红般的嘴唇，和他体格健壮的身形有些反差。"
    "He has thick, luscious hair, fair skin, and scarlet lips. They create a stark contrast with his muscular physique."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:316
translate english scene_c4_84df07ec:

    # "熟悉又陌生，我在哪里见过这双眼睛？"
    "He feels familiar… And yet he is not."
    "Just where have I seen these eyes before?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:317
translate english scene_c4_a052fbd1:

    # "理智 +10"
    "Rationality +10"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:321
translate english scene_c4_88b378b2:

    # "以我的判断，他应该是一个英俊的男子。若见君子，何不撩拨一番？"
    "If my guess is correct, he should be a handsome man. "
    "Why not tease a handsome man when you meet one?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:323
translate english scene_c4_8b24fd4e:

    # "我拾起桥边的柳絮，遮住我的脸庞，隔着柳絮，含情脉脉，轻声细语地问了他一个问题。"
    "I pick up a willow catkin that lay by the bridge to cover my face as I look at him flirtatiously and softly ask,"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:324
translate english scene_c4_8a5922fb:

    # placeholder "风凄凄，雨纷纷，郎君可知道，“枝上柳绵吹又少”，下一句是什么？"
    placeholder "Dear friend, do you hear the whisper of the wind and cries of the rain?"
    placeholder "If you're familiar with poems, do you recall this line? “Alas, most willow catkins have been blown away!” "
    placeholder "Why don't you tell me the next line?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:325
translate english scene_c4_3aacb806:

    # "男子一步一步向我走来，他低眉含笑， 好似想说这个套路也太老梗了。"
    "The man strides toward me. He looks at me smilingly, as if saying that this pickup line is too cliched."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:326
translate english scene_c4_e0787daa:

    # "撩拨玩的不就是套路吗，我倒要看看这家伙有多清高。"
    "But hey, flirting is all about the pickup lines."
    "I'd like to see just how aloof he is."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:328
translate english scene_c4_23dea256:

    # dude8 "枝上柳绵吹又少。天涯何处无芳草。天地之间，芳草虽盛多，我只想采撷眼前的柳絮，可好？"
    dude8 "“Alas, most willow catkins have been blown away! Yet sweet, fresh grasses grow wherever the sun shines.”"
    dude8 "There's so much grass growing in this world, but I only wish to pluck the willow catkin in front of me."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:329
translate english scene_c4_295e5eb9:

    # "他轻轻握住了我手上的柳絮，可是眼晴却直视我的眼睛，可见他想采撷不只是柳絮。"
    "Although he gently grips the willow catkin in my hand, his eyes are looking straight into mine."
    "Obviously, the willow catkin is not the only thing he wishes to pluck."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:330
translate english scene_c4_60ba011d:

    # "可能是我懂得太多套路，他说完这话我还是依旧心如止水。"
    "But perhaps because I know these maneuvers so well that his words don't strike a chord in me."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:332
translate english scene_c4_e9a37d09:

    # placeholder "芳草虽好，可柳絮哪比得上挑花呢？"
    placeholder "Sweet grass is good, but how could willow catkin ever compare to peach blossoms?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:333
translate english scene_c4_0312f718:

    # dude8 "诗人不都说桃李风前多妩媚，杨柳更温柔。"
    dude8 "Don't poets always say that “Peach blossoms are charming in the breeze, but the willow is more gentle”? "


# game/foxFairy.rpy:334
translate english scene_c4_750d5a31:

    # dude8 "可见有人对柳絮也是情有独钟。"
    dude8 "So you see, there are people who only have eyes for willow catkins too."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:335
translate english scene_c4_981d6d8c:

    # placeholder "杨柳更温柔？那郎君说说我和这柳絮比起来，谁更婆娑婀娜？"
    placeholder "the willow is more gentle?"
    placeholder "Why don't you tell me, between me and the willow catkin, who is more elegant and attractive?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:337
translate english scene_c4_424640ca:

    # "他的眉毛一提，似乎知道这题是个陷阱题，不能随便答复。"
    "He raised his eyebrow, knowing that this is a tricky question."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:338
translate english scene_c4_da0c3ef6:

    # dude8 "这柳絮上残留着夕阳的红霞与清早的露珠，惹人怜惜。"
    dude8 "Who won't grow fond of the catkins, where you can still see the red glow of the setting sun and the early morning dew on its surface?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:339
translate english scene_c4_94c89d05:

    # dude8 "可是这人比柳絮多了几分风姿卓约，几分娇态。"
    dude8 "But you're more endearing and gentle than the charming willow."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:340
translate english scene_c4_feee54aa:

    # dude8 "柳絮含带有依依不舍的含义，你是否可以将这柳絮送给我？"
    dude8 "Willow catkins have another meaning, \"missing you\"."
    dude8 "Can you give this catkins to me?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:342
translate english scene_c4_98d8cac6:

    # "我用手移开手中的柳绵，笑盈盈，不拒绝也不点头，好奇他会做什么。"
    "I move the willow catkin from my face and smile, neither confirming nor denying his statement because I'm curious to know what he will do."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:343
translate english scene_c4_dc79b9ef:

    # "雨势越来越急，风刮落了一些树上的柳絮，他不急不忙地让一些柳绵飘到了他的手中。"
    "The rain pours with increasing intensity, and the wind hacks at the willow catkins on the tree."
    "He calmly let some of them drift and land into his palm."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:344
translate english scene_c4_982b2527:

    # "见我注视着他，他勾唇一笑，把手上的柳絮放在了他胸前内层衣服，眼神有些暧昧。"
    "A smile tugs at his lips as he notices my gaze and proceeds to tuck the willow catkins into the inner pocket of his robes. "
    "His eyes glint flirtatiously."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:349
translate english scene_c5_8eb6df90:

    # dude8 "宓瑶，别来无恙？丰都一别，已是前尘往事。我来找你是为了我们五百年前的约定。"
    dude8 "How have you been, Mi Yao? It's been a long time since our last meeting in Fengdu."
    dude8 "I've been searching for you to fulfill the promise we made five hundred years ago."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:350
translate english scene_c5_65d63bfd:

    # "虽然不见他的面容， 他的声音很有磁性，气质不像一个平凡的人。"
    "Even though I can't see his face, his voice is attractive and his demeanor is not at all like a mortal."
    
