    # "他从袖子里拿出了一个别致的凤钗，示意让我看。"
    "He retrieves a beatific phoenix hairpin from his sleeve and shows it to me."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:352
translate english scene_c5_0e297ab2:

    # "我觉得他来找我是为了"
    "I think he came to find me because of"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:355
