    placeholder "How can I possibly accept this when I don't even know what you look like?"
    placeholder "I don't accept items of questionable origins."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:359
translate english scene_c5_cbc660f7:

    # "理智 +5"
    "rationality +5"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:363
translate english scene_c6_6f137a14:

    # dude8 "你还真是健忘，这凤钗是你送给我的见面礼。"
    dude8 "You really forget easily, don't you? You gifted this to me when we first met."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:365
translate english scene_c6_f4aa5fef:

    # placeholder "笑话，我为什么要送给你女子饰带的头饰呢？"
    placeholder "You're joking. Why would I give you a hair accessory worn by women?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:366
translate english scene_c6_98bf1fc1:

    # dude8 "你曾说女子的青丝就如情丝一般，而这凤钗乃是你的贴身之物，与你的情丝缠绵，它心系你的思念和情意。"
    dude8 "You once said that a woman's hair is like strands of her sentiments."
    dude8 "This phoenix hairpin was something you always wore and it was always surrounded by your sentiments."
    dude8 "It's a symbol of your longing and affection."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:367
translate english scene_c6_34ffac4c:

    # "我无法判断他说的是真是假，毕竟我太喜欢套路人了。"
    "I can't tell if what he's saying is true or not, since I really love to tease people."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:368
translate english scene_c6_992a5c7b:

    # "他看起来不像是凡尘中人，是否也有超脱世间的法力？"
    "He doesn't seem like a mortal. Does he also wield unimaginable power?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:369
translate english scene_c6_e7e21eb9:

    # "觉明给我的头绳是否有足够法力可以撇开这神秘人的面罩呢？"
    "Does the hair tie that Jueming gave me hold enough power to help me remove this mystery man's face veil?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:370
translate english scene_c6_b3a8c525:

    # "人人都说好奇害死猫，可我不是仙狐转世吗，狐狸总该比喵咪明智吧。"
    "People always say curiosity killed the cat, but I'm the reincarnation of a fox immortal, aren't I?"
    "A fox is definitely cleverer than a cat, right?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:371
translate english scene_c6_fd98ec35:

    # placeholder "（往前走）这凤钗的确是我的，可是几百年前的事，我早就不记得了。"
    placeholder "(gets closer) Yes, the hairpin used to be mine, but I've long forgotten the things that have happened hundreds of years ago. "
    placeholder "If you remove your veil and let me see your face, I'll definitely be able to remember who you are."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:372
translate english scene_c6_dd9e2b58:

    # placeholder "你若是把这些碍眼的面罩撇开，我见到你的面容，我绝对能分辨出你是谁。"
    placeholder ""

# game/foxFairy.rpy:373
translate english scene_c6_56722b7c:

    # "虽然我的语气听起来是礼貌地询问可否打开他的斗篷，我的手早已碰触到了他的面罩，不等他的回答。"
    "Although that sounds like I'm asking politely, I've already reached out to grab his veil without waiting for his answer."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:374
translate english scene_c6_a0c2e553:

    # "隔着面罩和绵绵细雨，他的肌肤有些冰冷。"
    "Under the drizzle and through the veil, his skin feels somewhat cold. "

# game/foxFairy.rpy:376
translate english scene_c6_e6cd4789:

    # "就当我要揭开这层层的阻碍与好奇时，他握住了我的手，把我的头轻轻按在他的胸前。"
    "Just as I am about to get rid of this hindrance and satiate my curiosity, he grabs hold of my wrist and gently pulls my head in to rest on his chest."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:377
translate english scene_c6_a1b312fc:

    # dude8 "你是装作不认识我，还是真的忘了？生死之约可不能随便反悔。"
    dude8 "Are you only pretending to not recognize me, or have you really forgotten? You can't back out from a promise of life and death on your whim."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:378
translate english scene_c6_fe7bb607:

    # placeholder "生死之约是什么意思?"
    placeholder "What's a promise of life and death?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:379
translate english scene_c6_5643aa16:

    # dude8 "（有些吃惊）你不记得了？"
    dude8 "(slightly shocked) You really forgot?"
# game/foxFairy.rpy:380
translate english scene_c6_cc361059:

    # dude8 "五百年果真漫长，长到你我如今只算是故人。算了，我今日找你是为了五百年前的承诺。"
    dude8 "Five hundred years is indeed a long time. It's such a long time that I've been reduced to only a stranger that you used to know. "
    dude8 "Never mind. I'm here today because of the promise we made five hundred years ago."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:381
translate english scene_c6_d1e1b3e4:

    # "我受不了动不动就把五百年放在嘴边的人。我连自己前天在哪里都不知道，更别说五百年前。"
    "Really, I can't stand that he keeps saying “five hundred years” when I don't even know where I was two days ago."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:382
translate english scene_c6_487ab7cc:

    # "他的眼神好像很受伤，搞得我一头雾水。"
    "His melancholic gaze further confuses me."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:383
translate english scene_c6_624d323b:

    # dude8 "收回你送给我的凤钗，我们就可以兑现曾今的承诺了。"
    dude8 "Reclaim this phoenix hairpin that you gave to me. Then, we can start to honor the promise we made."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:384
translate english scene_c6_18d46adb:

    # placeholder "什么承诺？"
    placeholder "What promise?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:385
translate english scene_c6_c3e3c2ac:

    # dude8 "还君凤钗时，红烛合卺夜。"
    dude8 "When the phoenix hairpin is returned, thus shall we tie the knot."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:387
translate english scene_c6_9cfd576f:

    # dude8 "（递给我一个黑色的玉帛）好好准备吧，新娘子。"
    dude8 "(pass me a piece of black jade) Prepare yourself, my bride."
# game/foxFairy.rpy:388
translate english scene_c6_4d44247e:

    # dude8 "十日后见，阴间的花轿会八抬大轿的送你来丰都鬼城，与我相聚。"
    dude8 "In ten days, a bridal palanquin with eight carriers from the netherworld will carry you to the Ghost City of Fengdu."
    dude8 "I will see you then."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:389
translate english scene_c6_1fde58a0:

    # placeholder "你说什么？我还不知道你长什么样子呢。"
    placeholder "What are you talking about? I still don't know what you look like."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:390
translate english scene_c6_d6240d14:

    # "作为外貌协会会长，我果断拒绝普男。"
    "As the president of the aesthetics club, ordinary men are strictly no-no for me."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:391
translate english scene_c6_4e142bbc:

    # dude8 "本来让你见到我也无妨，可是你竟然忘了我。"
    dude8 "I would've let you see my face, but you actually forgot about me."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:392
translate english scene_c6_3815ec3b:

    # dude8 "这是一个小惩罚，我就惩罚你洞房花烛夜在亲眼目睹你夫君我的风姿。"
    dude8 "Consider this a small punishment. You'll only get to see your husband's good looks during our wedding night."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:394
translate english scene_c6_ff1b1513:

    # "在朦胧雨中，犹如雾里看花，他一转身突然消失的无影无踪，就像从未出现一般。"
    "Trying to see in this downpour is like trying to peer through a thick veil of fog. "
    "In a blink of an eye, he turns around and disappears from my view as if he was never there in the first place."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:395
translate english scene_c6_017a7f49:

    # "我拾起他给我的玉帛，上面布满了金色图腾和一个“鬼”字。"
    " A golden pattern is etched into the jade with the word “ghost” in the middle of it."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:396
translate english scene_c6_c7f690f0:

    # "他说他会在丰都鬼城等我，难不成他是一个亡灵？"
    "He said he will be waiting for me in the Ghost City of Fengdu. Don't tell me he's a revenant?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:397
translate english scene_c6_8d060160:

    # "我自己刚从鬼门关借尸还魂到了阳间，出来不久就遇到一个亡灵想让我回去？"
    "I've only just been summoned back to the mortal realm from the dead, and already a revenant wants to send me back?"

# game/foxFairy.rpy:400
translate english scene_c6_7301ec7e:

    # "我留意到玉帛上的”鬼”字太让人毛骨悚然，也极其显眼。我决定丢了玉帛。"
    "The word “ghost” etched on it creeps me out and stands out too much. I'll throw this jade away."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:402
translate english scene_c6_6fcb29ca:

    # "这个凤钗虽然典雅，可是我才不想被人纠缠上呢。我决定丢了凤钗。"
    "Although it is refined and elegant, I don't want to be caught up in this affair. "
    "I'll throw this hairpin away."

# game/foxFairy.rpy:404
translate english scene_c6_26208c58:

    # "若是都丢了，我岂不是一点线索都没了。我决定留下这两个信物。"
    "If I throw them away, I'll lose all my clues. I'll keep both of these items."

